IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FASTPREFILL-V9.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-CHANNELS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CHUNK-KB            PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 NON-CONTIG-PAGES    PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FASTPREFILL-V9.
    IF NUM-CHANNELS == 0 OR CHUNK-KB == 0 OR NON-CONTIG-PAGES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 42400 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-CHANNELS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
